  "limitations": [
    "The three species share one study and assay pipeline; results do not show universality across laboratories or biomes",
    "Only reduced-representation SNPs are assessed, not whole genomes",
    "Held-out outcomes are genotype calls, not fitness, adaptation, population growth or intervention response",
    "The Dryad README states that loci observed only in historical specimens were manually removed as possible contamination before this archived SNP panel was produced; historical allele non-detection is conditional on this ascertainment.",
    "Historical allele absence is observed non-detection and is affected by sampling size and missingness",
    "Permutation P values assume individual-level label exchangeability and are post-outcome exploratory",
    "Genomic LOO bits per allele are predictive logscore units, not the exact CCOC response-interface memory bound",
    "No MLTR total replacement relations or action-conditioned response tables were empirically identified"
